*.local.json
# A copy of one holds the same token under a longer name (claude-config#1089): a backup such as
# config.local.json.bak-2026-10-12, a half written .writing copy, or an editor backup ending in ~.
*.local.json.*
*.local.json~
# The same shapes for a list kept as lines (claude-config#1568), which the sync keeps local alike.
*.local.txt
*.local.txt.*
*.local.txt~
